# Bot2 attacks on turn 4 with an Elvish Mystic and answers the Captain's trigger with Lightning Bolt on the Captain (it has
# 2 toughness). The ability is already on the stack and independent of its source: it still resolves and the damage is dealt by the
# Captain as it last existed (CR 113.7a), equal to the five cards left in Bot2's hand as it resolves (the Bolt has left it).
# Bot1 is still the monarch as it resolves, so the intervening if (CR 603.4) holds without its source.

